flowchart TD
  Claim[Reserve exact free cell + netkg + source claim] --> Ready{Fixture ready?}
  Ready -->|no| Prepare[Real worker visit / clear site / reused smoke]
  Prepare --> Pickup[Actual truck pickup boundary]
  Ready -->|yes| Pickup
  Pickup --> Access{Safe shelf service face available?}
  Access -->|yes| Carry[Acquire face / actual Ledger pickup / walk and deposit]
  Access -->|no| Wait[Wait before pickup / goods remain aboard / cell promise retained]
  Event[Specific blocker clears / promise released / actual topology change] --> Wait
  Wait -->|event schedules boundary| Access
  Carry --> Commit[One real deposit / consume cell promise / release face]
  Commit --> Event
